My conversation is going on.
Suddenly, a loud sound is heard.
"Bow wow!" a dog barks.
Who is she?
She is my dog, Lola!
Lola suddenly jumps in front of the camera.
I laugh loudly.
Her colour is brown.
I say with affection, "Lola!"
"How are you?"
Lola looks at the screen.
She sees me.
She barks again.
I say, "You are a good dog."
"You are my good girl."
My family laughs.
Sofia says, "Lola, look!"
"This is Maya."
Lola wags her tail with joy.
I am also very happy.
